<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020" />
  <title>Three Intelligences Explorer | André Baumann</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Interactive 3D demo exploring individual, collective, and planetary intelligence using transparent public-indicator proxies."
  />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/css/site.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
  <script src="https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.35.2.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="../../index.html">André Baumann</a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="../../index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="../../art/">Art</a>
        <a href="../../music/">Music</a>
        <a href="../index.html" aria-current="page">Demos</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container intelligence-demo">
    <section class="hero intelligence-hero">
      <div class="panel">
        <span class="eyebrow">Experimental systems intelligence</span>
        <h1>Three Intelligences Explorer</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          A 3D, browser-native model for exploring the relationship between individual capability,
          collective coordination, and planetary stewardship.
        </p>
        <p>
          The demo loads public World Bank indicator proxies where possible, then computes transparent
          composite scores. It is a reasoning instrument, not a definitive ranking. That distinction is
          small but, as humans say, rather important.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button" href="../index.html">Back to Demos</a>
          <a class="button primary" href="#explorer">Open Explorer</a>
          <a class="button" href="#model">Model Logic</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel quick-facts">
        <div>
          <strong>Mode</strong>
          <span id="dataMode">Loading empirical indicators…</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Displayed countries</strong>
          <span id="displayedCount">0</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Indicator source</strong>
          <span>World Bank API + transparent fallback</span>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section id="explorer" class="section explorer-shell">
      <div class="panel controls-panel">
        <h2>Controls</h2>
        <p class="muted small">Filter the system. Click a point to inspect the country profile.</p>

        <label for="regionFilter">Region</label>
        <select id="regionFilter"></select>

        <label for="countrySearch">Search country</label>
        <input id="countrySearch" type="text" placeholder="Ireland, Italy, Singapore…" />

        <label for="minSynergy">Minimum synergy: <span id="minSynergyValue">0</span></label>
        <input id="minSynergy" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="0" />

        <label for="colourMode">Colour points by</label>
        <select id="colourMode">
          <option value="archetype">Archetype</option>
          <option value="region">Region</option>
          <option value="synergy">Overall synergy</option>
        </select>

        <div class="button-row control-buttons">
          <button id="resetCamera" type="button" class="button">Reset view</button>
          <button id="clearFilters" type="button" class="button">Clear filters</button>
        </div>

        <div class="metric-grid">
          <div class="metric-card"><span>Avg individual</span><strong id="avgIndividual">0</strong></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span>Avg collective</span><strong id="avgCollective">0</strong></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span>Avg planetary</span><strong id="avgPlanetary">0</strong></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span>Completeness</span><strong id="avgCompleteness">0%</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="plot-stack">
        <div id="plot" class="panel plot-panel" aria-label="Interactive 3D intelligence plot"></div>
        <div class="panel selected-panel">
          <h2>Selected country</h2>
          <div id="selectedCountry" class="selected-country">
            <p class="muted">Click a marker in the 3D plot to inspect details, source years, and score logic.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="model" class="section grid two">
      <article class="demo-card">
        <h3>What the axes mean</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          <strong>Individual intelligence</strong> is modelled as human-capital and digital-access capability.
          <strong>Collective intelligence</strong> is modelled through governance and coordination indicators.
          <strong>Planetary intelligence</strong> is modelled as stewardship capacity and reduced ecological pressure.
        </p>
        <div class="tag-row">
          <span class="tag">Human capital</span>
          <span class="tag">Governance</span>
          <span class="tag">Planetary stewardship</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="demo-card">
        <h3>Why this is not a league table</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          The aim is to make assumptions visible. Each score is a transparent composite of public proxy indicators,
          not a claim that one country is inherently smarter than another. The useful signal is the pattern: capability,
          coordination, and stewardship can diverge.
        </p>
        <div class="tag-row">
          <span class="tag">Transparent weights</span>
          <span class="tag">Proxy indicators</span>
          <span class="tag">Scenario logic</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Indicator logic</h2>
      <div id="indicatorTable" class="panel indicator-table-wrap">Loading indicator model…</div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>References and source notes</h2>
      <div class="grid two">
        <article class="demo-card">
          <h3>Data sources</h3>
          <ul class="list-clean muted">
            <li><strong>World Bank HCI:</strong> education-health human capability proxy.</li>
            <li><strong>World Bank WGI:</strong> governance and institutional coordination proxy.</li>
            <li><strong>World Bank WDI:</strong> digital access, education, health, emissions, renewables, protected areas, forest area, and air pollution.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="demo-card">
          <h3>Conceptual sources</h3>
          <ul class="list-clean muted">
            <li>Woolley et al. on collective intelligence in groups.</li>
            <li>Frank, Grinspoon, and Walker on intelligence as a planetary-scale process.</li>
            <li>Model logic and weightings are explicitly experimental.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-row">
      <p>© André Baumann · Three Intelligences Explorer</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="app.js" defer></script>
